'''Darr''' was an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|wizard tower}}. They were exclusive to the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]].

== Purpose ==
'''Darr''' gave {{Item|Grand Experience Bottle|amount=32}}s when spoken to, allowing for easy access to the [[Rift Dimension]].

